# ==============================================================================
# .aiexclude — files kept out of the context of the tools that read this file
# (such as Gemini Code Assist).
#
# Generated by Perci. Check and adapt it to your project.
#
# This is a context filter, not a security boundary: it does not stop an
# agent that can run shell commands. Claude Code does not read this file; its
# equivalent read rules are in .claude/settings.json (permissions.deny).
# ==============================================================================

